                 I R C   W E A T H E R   B O T
                            v1.01

+------------------------------------------------------------+
| IRC-WEATHER-BOT_V1.01.PY                                   |
|------------------------------------------------------------|
| Python IRC weather / utility bot for Libera.Chat and       |
| compatible IRC servers.                                    |
|                                                            |
| [*] WeatherAPI current conditions                          |
| [*] 2-day weather forecasts                                |
| [*] ZIP / City / Lat-Lon lookup                            |
| [*] TLS + SASL authentication                              |
| [*] Auto reconnect / nickname recovery                     |
| [*] User and global rate limiting                          |
| [*] API response caching                                   |
| [*] Random !warez responses                                |
| [*] #stab channel amusement                                |
| [*] Daily rotating logfile                                 |
|                                                            |
| FreeBSD / Linux  |  Python 3.12+                           |
|                                                            |
| github.com/GregWirth/IRC-weather-bot                       |
+------------------------------------------------------------+

        "If it breaks, blame quantum-level fluctuations."
